{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your ever-growing settlement! Use the resources at your disposal to build  structures necessary for survival. Research new structures with a variety of functionalities. When resources grow scarce, explore your surroundings for more. Encounter other settlements and deal with them using diplomacy or hostility. Create sprawling settlements, organized central villages, or anything in between- whatever works to expand your domain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to build new structures and keep your settlers alive. Resource management is essential for a thriving settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/67ce2d1c2bcc5a3ffd725a8f212d07c1.poster.avif?t=1773952352\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/67ce2d1c2bcc5a3ffd725a8f212d07c1.webm?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/67ce2d1c2bcc5a3ffd725a8f212d07c1.mp4?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use resources to build structures with a variety of uses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/f9c32209be1b2ef98178099b209f31aa.poster.avif?t=1773952352\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/f9c32209be1b2ef98178099b209f31aa.webm?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/f9c32209be1b2ef98178099b209f31aa.mp4?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear away the unknown to discover more resources and and other settlements in a procedural world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/fe6a652901028ac0e67104530c01f3c3.poster.avif?t=1773952352\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/fe6a652901028ac0e67104530c01f3c3.webm?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/fe6a652901028ac0e67104530c01f3c3.mp4?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Influence to recruit new settlers to your cause. Larger populations can produce more resources, but need more food, medicine, and housing to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/9d47ec88fcb44f444f9185f9616cf3df.poster.avif?t=1773952352\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/9d47ec88fcb44f444f9185f9616cf3df.webm?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/9d47ec88fcb44f444f9185f9616cf3df.mp4?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Research</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new structures from a large tech tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/769b5dcf6d9ed0863aec3f2ab03205b0.poster.avif?t=1773952352\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/769b5dcf6d9ed0863aec3f2ab03205b0.webm?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/769b5dcf6d9ed0863aec3f2ab03205b0.mp4?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diplomacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with other settlements in a variety of ways. Figure out a way to deal with them without losing your settlers- or your settlement- in the process.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/53e9ba09de8d4fc8c7165870f3c4d5a1.poster.avif?t=1773952352\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/53e9ba09de8d4fc8c7165870f3c4d5a1.webm?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/53e9ba09de8d4fc8c7165870f3c4d5a1.mp4?t=1773952352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396920?t=1773952352","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396920?t=1773952352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps